# The NES emulator runs a test ROM with mapper 0. The ROM is grid.nes in gui/data/rom, which gui/data/mkroms.py makes. It draws a fixed picture and then loops, so the script is an exact test. The ROM fills the name table and the attribute table with a grid of tiles. The Del key stops the emulator.
class exact
window 500x400
run mount -nc '#Z/hostfs' /mnt/term; games/nes /mnt/term/rom/grid.nes
pause 3
quiet
snap rom
exit "\x7f"
